config PSA_CRYPTO_DRIVER_KLAUSSCPU
	bool "KlaussCPU crypto block as a PSA accelerator driver"
	default y
	depends on MBEDTLS
	help
	  SHA-256 (and with it HMAC-SHA-256) for TF-PSA-Crypto on the
	  KlaussCPU SHA block, when the bitstream has state save/restore.
	  Needs zephyr-patches/tf-psa-crypto-klausscpu.patch.
